---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { whatsappLink, WHATSAPP_NUMBER, LINKEDIN_URL } from '../data/navigation';

// Se conserva el canal comercial ya configurado en la V2.
// WhatsApp NO envía el mensaje automáticamente: la persona debe enviarlo.
const conversation = 'Hola, quiero que evalúen si Digital Motor puede trabajar con mi empresa. Empresa: [nombre]. El principal obstáculo comercial que tenemos es: ';
const whatsappHref = whatsappLink(conversation);
const phoneHref = `tel:+${WHATSAPP_NUMBER}`;
const criteria = [
  { number: '01', text: 'Ya tenés ventas y un negocio en marcha.' },
  { number: '02', text: 'Podés invertir para resolver un problema real.' },
  { number: '03', text: 'Estás dispuesto a medir y ejecutar cambios.' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Digital Motor | Growth Partner para empresas que ya venden"
  description="Digital Motor selecciona proyectos de crecimiento comercial: estrategia, adquisición, conversión y ventas. Evaluamos si podemos aportar valor antes de trabajar juntos."
  bodyClass="dm-v4-page"
>
  <div class="dmv4" id="dmv4-start">
    <!-- Navegación principal de la landing: sin catálogo de servicios. -->
    <div class="dmv4-topbar">
      <a class="dmv4-brand" href="/" aria-label="digitAI Motor, inicio">
        <img class="dmv4-brand-symbol" src="/assets/dm-sacred-mark.webp" alt="" width="42" height="54" decoding="async" />
        <span class="dmv4-brand-name">digit<span>AI</span> Motor</span>
      </a>
      <span class="dmv4-category">GROWTH PARTNER <b aria-hidden="true">/</b> ARGENTINA · LATAM</span>
      <a class="dmv4-top-action" href={whatsappHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="v4_whatsapp_header">
        HABLEMOS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- UN SOLO HERO, UNA SOLA IDEA, CONTACTO EN EL PRIMER PANTALLAZO. -->
    <section class="dmv4-hero" aria-labelledby="dmv4-title">
      <div class="dmv4-main">
        <p class="dmv4-label"><span class="dmv4-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> 01 / SELECCIÓN DE PROYECTOS</p>
        <h1 id="dmv4-title">
          <span>NO</span>
          <span>ACEPTAMOS</span>
          <span class="dmv4-accent">CUALQUIER</span>
          <span>PROYECTO<span class="dmv4-stop">.</span></span>
        </h1>
        <div class="dmv4-pitch">
          <p>Trabajamos con empresas que <strong>ya venden</strong> y tienen un problema de crecimiento que podemos diagnosticar, medir y resolver.</p>
          <p class="dmv4-note">Antes de empezar, evaluamos si realmente podemos aportar valor.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="dmv4-actions">
          <a class="dmv4-cta" href={whatsappHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="v4_whatsapp_primary">
            <span>QUIERO QUE EVALÚEN MI EMPRESA</span>
            <span class="dmv4-cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
          <a class="dmv4-secondary" href={phoneHref} data-track="v4_phone_click">O llamanos directamente <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="dmv4-smallprint">Hablás directamente con nosotros. Sin formularios interminables.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="dmv4-side" aria-label="Criterios de evaluación comercial">
        <div class="dmv4-side-top"><span>DM / GROWTH</span><span>CRITERIOS DE ENTRADA ↗</span></div>
        <div class="dmv4-diagram" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="dmv4-axis"></span><span class="dmv4-orbit a"></span><span class="dmv4-orbit b"></span>
          <div class="dmv4-emblem-disc"><img class="dmv4-sacred-logo" src="/assets/dm-sacred-mark.webp" alt="Isotipo geométrico DM de digitAI Motor" width="720" height="897" decoding="async" /></div><span class="dmv4-coordinates">MARKETING × SALES × SYSTEMS</span>
        </div>
        <h2>ENTRAMOS<br />CUANDO<span class="dmv4-colon">:</span></h2>
        <ol class="dmv4-criteria">
          {criteria.map((item) => <li><span>{item.number}</span><p>{item.text}</p></li>)}
        </ol>
        <p class="dmv4-side-foot">SI NO VEMOS UNA OPORTUNIDAD CONCRETA, TE LO DECIMOS.</p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <!-- Cinta editorial continua. El duplicado está oculto a lectores de pantalla. -->
    <div class="dmv4-ticker" aria-label="Capacidades comerciales: ventas B2B, paid media, conversión, datos y tecnología">
      <div class="dmv4-ticker-track">
        <div class="dmv4-ticker-set"><span>VENTAS B2B</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b><span>PAID MEDIA</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b><span>CONVERSIÓN</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b><span>DATOS</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b><span>TECNOLOGÍA</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b></div>
        <div class="dmv4-ticker-set" aria-hidden="true"><span>VENTAS B2B</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b><span>PAID MEDIA</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b><span>CONVERSIÓN</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b><span>DATOS</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b><span>TECNOLOGÍA</span><b aria-hidden="true">✳</b></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="dmv4-close" aria-labelledby="dmv4-close-title">
      <div class="dmv4-close-grid">
        <div class="dmv4-close-head">
          <span>02 / NUESTRA REGLA</span>
          <h2 id="dmv4-close-title">PRIMERO<br />EL NEGOCIO<span>.</span><br />DESPUÉS<br />LOS ADS.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="dmv4-close-body">
          <p>No vendemos campañas porque sí. Encontramos dónde se pierde valor entre la consulta y la venta. Si existe una oportunidad real, proponemos una intervención. Si no, preferimos no tomar el proyecto.</p>
          <a class="dmv4-close-link" href={whatsappHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="v4_whatsapp_footer">
            EMPEZAR UNA CONVERSACIÓN <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <footer class="dmv4-footer">
        <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} DIGITAI MOTOR · GROWTH PARTNER</span>
        <div><a href="/privacy/">PRIVACIDAD</a><a href={LINKEDIN_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LINKEDIN ↗</a></div>
      </footer>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Home V4: oculta el header y footer de la plantilla anterior solo en esta página. */
  :global(body.dm-v4-page .site-header),
  :global(body.dm-v4-page .site-footer) { display: none; }
  :global(body.dm-v4-page) { background: #f5f2e9; }
  :global(body.dm-v4-page #main) { width: 100%; }
  :global(body.dm-v4-page .skip-link) { z-index: 9999; }

  .dmv4 { --ink: #131416; --paper: #f5f2e9; --blue: #294ce5; --lemon: #f2eca4; --border: rgba(19,20,22,.18); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif; overflow: clip; }
  .dmv4 * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .dmv4 a { text-decoration: none; }
  .dmv4 :is(h1,h2,h3,p) { margin: 0; }
  .dmv4-topbar { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; align-items: center; min-height: 79px; padding: 0 clamp(22px,3.2vw,58px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); position: relative; z-index: 3; background: var(--paper); }
  .dmv4-brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; width: max-content; color: var(--ink); }
  .dmv4-brand:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  .dmv4-brand-name { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.065em; white-space: nowrap; }
  .dmv4-brand-name span { color: var(--blue); }
  .dmv4-brand-symbol { width:32px; height:43px; object-fit:contain; flex:none; filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 2px rgba(14,31,73,.08)); }
  .dmv4-category { justify-self: center; color: #525458; font-weight: 800; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .15em; white-space: nowrap; }
  .dmv4-category b { margin: 0 9px; color: var(--blue); }
  .dmv4-top-action { justify-self: end; color: var(--ink); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .08em; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); padding: 9px 0; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; }
  .dmv4-top-action:hover { color: var(--blue); border-bottom-color: var(--blue); }
  .dmv4-top-action span { font-size: 20px; }
  .dmv4-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(320px, .75fr); min-height: min(900px, calc(100svh - 79px)); }
  .dmv4-main { position: relative; padding: clamp(32px,3.7vw,62px) clamp(24px,4.1vw,75px) clamp(36px,4vw,62px) clamp(24px,5.4vw,100px); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:center; }
  .dmv4-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .17em; margin-bottom: clamp(24px,2.7vw,42px)!important; }
  .dmv4-dot { display:inline-block; width:9px; height:9px; background:var(--blue); transform:rotate(45deg); margin-right:12px; }
  .dmv4 h1 { font-family: Impact, 'Arial Narrow', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(65px, 7.0vw, 124px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.044em; line-height: .87; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink); max-width:100%; margin: 0 0 clamp(27px,2.9vw,48px); text-wrap:nowrap; }
  .dmv4 h1 > span { display: block; }
  .dmv4 h1 .dmv4-accent { color:var(--blue); }
  .dmv4-stop { color:var(--blue); }
  .dmv4-pitch { display:grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0,.72fr); gap:30px; width:100%; max-width:880px; align-items:start; }
  .dmv4-pitch p { font-size: clamp(16px,1.45vw,20px); line-height: 1.38; color:var(--ink); letter-spacing:-.02em; }
  .dmv4-pitch strong { color:var(--ink); font-weight:900; }
  .dmv4-pitch .dmv4-note { color:#5c5b59; font-size: clamp(12px,1vw,14px); line-height:1.5; border-left:2px solid var(--blue); padding-left:14px; }
  .dmv4-actions { display:flex; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:22px; margin-top: clamp(26px,2.7vw,42px); width:100%; }
  .dmv4-cta { display:flex; gap: clamp(28px,3vw,65px); justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; background:var(--ink); padding:18px 19px 18px 23px; color:var(--paper); font-size: clamp(11px,.9vw,13px); font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.065em; min-height:65px; transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
  .dmv4-cta:hover { background:var(--blue); color:white; transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .dmv4-cta-arrow { font-size:25px; color:var(--lemon); line-height:1; }
  .dmv4-secondary { font-weight:800; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); white-space:nowrap; border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink); padding:7px 0; }
  .dmv4-secondary:hover { color:var(--blue); border-color:var(--blue); }
  .dmv4-smallprint { font-size:11px; color:#77746d; margin-top:19px!important; }
  .dmv4-side { position:relative; color:var(--paper); background:var(--blue); padding: clamp(27px,2.7vw,46px); display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-end; overflow:hidden; isolation:isolate; }
  .dmv4-side-top { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:15px; position:absolute; top:34px; left:clamp(27px,2.7vw,46px); right:clamp(27px,2.7vw,46px); z-index:3; font-size:10px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.12em; white-space:nowrap; }
  .dmv4-diagram { position:relative; display:grid; place-items:center; min-height:clamp(150px,18vw,270px); isolation:isolate; }
  .dmv4-axis { position:absolute; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.48); top:50%; left:-40%; right:-40%; transform:rotate(-27deg); }
  .dmv4-orbit { position:absolute; width:clamp(155px,16vw,230px); aspect-ratio:1; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.65); border-radius:50%; }
  .dmv4-orbit.a { transform:scale(1.35); border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.24); }
  .dmv4-orbit.b { transform:scale(1.16); border-width:1px; background:transparent; border-color:rgba(247,232,167,.48); }
  .dmv4-emblem-disc { position:relative; z-index:2; width:clamp(188px,17vw,242px); aspect-ratio:1; display:grid; place-items:center; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle at 44% 38%,#fff 0%,#F6F2E8 60%,#E9E0CA 100%); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.72); box-shadow:0 14px 42px rgba(8,14,58,.23), inset 0 0 22px rgba(255,255,255,.92); }
  .dmv4-sacred-logo { display:block; width:84%; height:112%; max-width:100%; object-fit:contain; filter:drop-shadow(0 3px 3px rgba(20,30,69,.12)); }
  .dmv4-coordinates { position:absolute; bottom:0; right:0; font-size:9px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; writing-mode:vertical-rl; }
  .dmv4-side h2 { font-family:Impact,'Arial Narrow',sans-serif; color:#fff; font-size: clamp(50px,5vw,77px); letter-spacing:-.025em; line-height:.88; margin-top:clamp(22px,2.5vw,40px); }
  .dmv4-colon { color:var(--lemon); }
  .dmv4-criteria { list-style:none; margin:22px 0 24px; padding:0; }
  .dmv4-criteria li { display:grid; grid-template-columns:32px 1fr; padding:12px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.44); gap:8px; font-size:clamp(12px,1vw,14px); line-height:1.35; }
  .dmv4-criteria li span { font-size:10px; color:var(--lemon); font-weight:900; padding-top:3px; }
  .dmv4-criteria li p { font-weight:600; color:white; }
  .dmv4-side-foot { font-size:10px; line-height:1.5; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.1em; color:var(--lemon); max-width:27ch; }
  .dmv4-ticker { min-height:62px; display:flex; align-items:center; overflow:hidden; border-top:1px solid var(--ink); border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink); color:var(--ink); background:var(--lemon); }
  .dmv4-ticker-track { display:flex; align-items:center; width:max-content; flex:none; animation:dmv4-marquee 26s linear infinite; }
  .dmv4-ticker-set { display:flex; gap:clamp(22px,3vw,48px); align-items:center; padding:14px clamp(22px,3vw,48px) 14px 0; flex:none; white-space:nowrap; }
  .dmv4-ticker span { font-size:clamp(10px,.95vw,13px); font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.1em; }
  .dmv4-ticker b { color:var(--blue); font-size:17px; }
  .dmv4-ticker:hover .dmv4-ticker-track { animation-play-state:paused; }
  .dmv4-close { background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); padding: clamp(55px,7vw,118px) clamp(24px,5.4vw,100px) 25px; }
  .dmv4-close-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.07fr .93fr; gap:12%; align-items:end; padding-bottom: clamp(60px,7vw,110px); }
  .dmv4-close-head > span { font-size:11px; color:var(--lemon); font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.14em; }
  .dmv4-close h2 { color:var(--paper); font-family:Impact,'Arial Narrow',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(58px,7vw,120px); letter-spacing:-.03em; line-height:.88; margin-top:22px; }
  .dmv4-close h2 span { color:var(--lemon); }
  .dmv4-close-body { padding-bottom:10px; }
  .dmv4-close-body p { font-size:clamp(19px,1.9vw,29px); max-width:570px; line-height:1.35; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-.035em; margin-bottom:40px; color:var(--paper); }
  .dmv4-close-link { display:inline-flex; width:100%; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:15px; border-top:1px solid #777; padding-top:19px; font-size:clamp(12px,1.2vw,17px); font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.06em; color:var(--lemon); }
  .dmv4-close-link:hover { color:white; }
  .dmv4-close-link span { font-size:30px; }
  .dmv4-footer { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:25px; border-top:1px solid #626267; padding-top:20px; align-items:center; font-size:10px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.08em; }
  .dmv4-footer div { display:flex; gap:26px; }
  .dmv4-footer a { color:#d1d0d0; }
  .dmv4-footer a:hover { color:var(--lemon); }
  @media(max-width:1250px) {
    .dmv4-hero { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.12fr) minmax(290px,.88fr); }
    .dmv4 h1 { font-size: clamp(60px,7vw,99px); }
    .dmv4-pitch { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:12px; }
    .dmv4-actions { gap:12px; }
  }
  @media(max-width:820px) {
    .dmv4-topbar { grid-template-columns:1fr auto; min-height:72px; }
    .dmv4-category { display:none; }
    .dmv4-hero { grid-template-columns:1fr; min-height:0; }
    .dmv4-main { padding:50px 28px 55px; }
    .dmv4 h1 { font-size:clamp(65px,11vw,105px); }
    .dmv4-pitch { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,.8fr); }
    .dmv4-side { padding:35px; display:grid; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr; gap:20px; align-items:center; }
    .dmv4-side-top { display:none; }
    .dmv4-side h2 { grid-column:1; grid-row:1; }
    .dmv4-diagram { grid-column:1; grid-row:2; min-height:170px; }
    .dmv4-criteria { grid-column:2; grid-row:1 / span 2; }
    .dmv4-side-foot { grid-column:1 / -1; }
    .dmv4-close-grid { gap:8%; }
  }
  @media(max-width:580px) {
    .dmv4-topbar { min-height:64px; padding:0 18px; }
    .dmv4-brand-name { font-size:19px; }
    .dmv4-brand-symbol { width:29px; height:38px; }
    .dmv4-top-action { font-size:10px; gap:7px; }
    .dmv4-main { padding:38px 18px 41px; }
    .dmv4-label { margin-bottom:28px!important; }
    .dmv4 h1 { font-size:clamp(53px,14.6vw,83px); line-height:.91; letter-spacing:-.045em; margin-bottom:26px; }
    .dmv4-pitch { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:8px; }
    .dmv4-pitch p { font-size:17px; max-width:37ch; line-height:1.4; }
    .dmv4-pitch .dmv4-note { font-size:12px; margin-top:8px; }
    .dmv4-actions { flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; gap:10px; margin-top:27px; }
    .dmv4-cta { width:100%; min-height:61px; padding:14px 14px 14px 18px; gap:12px; font-size:11px; }
    .dmv4-secondary { align-self:flex-start; font-size:12px; }
    .dmv4-smallprint { margin-top:14px!important; }
    .dmv4-side { display:block; padding:32px 22px; }
    .dmv4-side h2 { font-size:53px; margin-top:0; }
    .dmv4-diagram { display:grid; min-height:186px; margin:10px auto 3px; }
    .dmv4-emblem-disc { width:165px; }
    .dmv4-orbit { width:150px; }
    .dmv4-coordinates { display:none; }
    .dmv4-criteria { margin:22px 0 20px; }
    .dmv4-ticker { min-height:53px; }
    .dmv4-ticker span { font-size:10px; }
    .dmv4-close { padding:60px 20px 25px; }
    .dmv4-close-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:45px; }
    .dmv4-close h2 { font-size:clamp(62px,14vw,88px); }
    .dmv4-close-body p { font-size:21px; }
    .dmv4-footer { flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:16px; font-size:9px; }
  }

  /* V4 Motion: dinamismo editorial con CSS puro. No se incorporan librerías ni videos. */
  @keyframes dmv4-rise {
    from { opacity:0; transform:translate3d(0,22px,0); }
    to { opacity:1; transform:translate3d(0,0,0); }
  }
  @keyframes dmv4-unmask {
    from { opacity:0; transform:translate3d(0,56px,0); }
    to { opacity:1; transform:translate3d(0,0,0); }
  }
  @keyframes dmv4-marquee { to { transform:translate3d(-50%,0,0); } }
  @keyframes dmv4-orbit-spin { to { transform:rotate(360deg) scale(1.35); } }
  @keyframes dmv4-center-float {
    0%,100% { transform:translate3d(0,4px,0); }
    50% { transform:translate3d(0,-5px,0); }
  }
  @keyframes dmv4-signal {
    0%,100% { box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(41,76,229,.15); }
    50% { box-shadow:0 0 0 9px rgba(41,76,229,0); }
  }
  @keyframes dmv4-arrow-arrive {
    0%,100% { transform:translate3d(0,0,0); }
    50% { transform:translate3d(3px,-3px,0); }
  }
  @keyframes dmv4-panel-enter {
    from { opacity:.8; transform:translate3d(34px,0,0); }
    to { opacity:1; transform:translate3d(0,0,0); }
  }
  @keyframes dmv4-axis-scan {
    0%,100% { transform:rotate(-27deg) translateX(0); }
    50% { transform:rotate(-27deg) translateX(16px); }
  }
  .dmv4-topbar { animation:dmv4-rise .55s both cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); }
  .dmv4-label { animation:dmv4-rise .7s .12s both cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); }
  .dmv4 h1 > span { animation:dmv4-unmask .8s both cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1); }
  .dmv4 h1 > span:nth-child(1) { animation-delay:.08s; }
  .dmv4 h1 > span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay:.17s; }
  .dmv4 h1 > span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay:.26s; }
  .dmv4 h1 > span:nth-child(4) { animation-delay:.35s; }
  .dmv4-pitch { animation:dmv4-rise .7s .35s both cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); }
  .dmv4-actions { animation:dmv4-rise .7s .45s both cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); }
  .dmv4-smallprint { animation:dmv4-rise .7s .53s both cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); }
  .dmv4-side { animation:dmv4-panel-enter 1.05s .14s both cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1); }
  .dmv4-orbit.a { border-style:dashed; animation:dmv4-orbit-spin 28s linear infinite; }
  .dmv4-emblem-disc { animation:dmv4-center-float 5s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .dmv4-sacred-logo { transition:transform .7s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1); }
  .dmv4-emblem-disc:hover .dmv4-sacred-logo { transform:scale(1.055); }
  .dmv4-axis { animation:dmv4-axis-scan 8s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .dmv4-dot { animation:dmv4-signal 2.5s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .dmv4-cta { position:relative; overflow:hidden; isolation:isolate; }
  .dmv4-cta-arrow { animation:dmv4-arrow-arrive 2.6s ease-in-out infinite; transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1); }
  .dmv4-cta:hover .dmv4-cta-arrow { animation:none; transform:translate3d(5px,-5px,0); }
  .dmv4-criteria li { transition:padding-left .28s ease,background-color .28s ease; }
  .dmv4-criteria li:hover { padding-left:9px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.065); }
  .dmv4-close-link span,.dmv4-top-action span { transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1); }
  .dmv4-close-link:hover span,.dmv4-top-action:hover span { transform:translate3d(4px,-4px,0); }
  /* Respeto por el ajuste del dispositivo, sin esconder contenido ni frenar CTA. */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
    .dmv4 *, .dmv4 *::before, .dmv4 *::after { animation:none!important; transition:none!important; scroll-behavior:auto!important; }
    .dmv4-ticker-track { animation:none!important; }
    .dmv4-ticker { overflow-x:auto; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  // Progressive enhancement: fuera del viewport el contenido SIEMPRE es legible.
  // Cuando entra, una sola aparición sobria. Sin dependencias.
  const respectsReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  if (!respectsReducedMotion && 'IntersectionObserver' in window) {
    const watcher = new IntersectionObserver((entries, observer) => {
      for (const entry of entries) {
        if (!entry.isIntersecting) continue;
        if (entry.target instanceof HTMLElement) {
          entry.target.animate(
            [
              { opacity: 0.45, transform: 'translateY(24px)' },
              { opacity: 1, transform: 'translateY(0)' },
            ],
            { duration: 700, easing: 'cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)' },
          );
        }
        observer.unobserve(entry.target);
      }
    }, { threshold: 0.16 });
    document.querySelectorAll('.dmv4-close-head, .dmv4-close-body').forEach(el => watcher.observe(el));
  }
</script>
